1
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:17,460
Here,

2
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,010
have a bite of the bun.

3
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:22,390
[Half a month ago]

4
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,260
Never thought

5
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,300
I'd take in a sidekick here.

6
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,080
He's called Lyu Ruhui.

7
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,990
He's really something.

8
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,820
He masters some mystical tricks.

9
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,950
The guy's quite tall

10
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,320
and energetic,

11
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:31,780
with thick eyebrows

12
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,270
and big eyes.

13
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:34,000
Blessing generations to come!

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,830
He actually pulled off the trick of
Three Immortals Eating Noodles.

15
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,090
I told him to follow me,

16
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:39,430
and I'd have his back.

17
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:41,060
Were it not for this young man,

18
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,420
I would've died
on the Corpse Driving journey.

19
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,320
I'm a human!

20
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:45,430
Who would've thought those bastards
were smuggling opium?

21
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,160
Opium paste?

22
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,300
Also,

23
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,570
he said he was going
to the Qian family's place.

24
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:52,130
He said his name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

25
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:53,730
My real name isn't Lyu Ruhui.

26
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:55,860
My name is Shangguan Chengming.

27
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:41,750
[A Prophet]

28
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:44,730
[Episode 7]

29
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:48,040
[Qianshan Station]

30
00:02:48,070 --> 00:02:49,790
[Seven days ago]

31
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:07,080
It's indeed not enough for me.

32
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,460
Spare me, sir!

33
00:03:22,510 --> 00:03:23,230
We're all

34
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:24,510
in the same business.

35
00:03:32,579 --> 00:03:33,440
Second Master,

36
00:03:33,750 --> 00:03:35,210
someone is here to see you.

37
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:41,100
You didn't expect this, did you?

38
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:42,140
I'm still alive.

39
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:44,260
Who are you?

40
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:46,390
You threw me into the river,

41
00:03:46,540 --> 00:03:48,100
and you've already forgotten it?

42
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:49,540
This guy is a fraud!

43
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:51,070
He used my name

44
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,700
to sneak into Longxuya

45
00:03:52,790 --> 00:03:54,260
and got Chief Du killed!

46
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,430
You have nothing to back that up.

47
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,820
Why should we believe you?

48
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:59,540
When the incident happened at Longxuya,

49
00:03:59,540 --> 00:04:00,580
I saw him

50
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:02,260
with Feng Siyuan.

51
00:04:02,910 --> 00:04:03,750
This guy

52
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,260
used Feng Siyuan

53
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:06,620
to wipe out Longxuya.

54
00:04:06,660 --> 00:04:08,720
He's now targeting your Qian family!

55
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:10,750
Is what he said true?

56
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,920
What are you doing?

57
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:12,700
Second Brother!

58
00:04:12,700 --> 00:04:14,100
Was he telling the truth?

59
00:04:19,339 --> 00:04:20,019
Yes,

60
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:22,970
I work for Commander Feng.

61
00:04:23,550 --> 00:04:25,610
Blind Du is a mere opium smuggler.

62
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:26,950
The real source

63
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:28,550
is the buyer pulling the strings—

64
00:04:28,550 --> 00:04:29,350
Mingcao Hall,

65
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:30,310
the Qian family.

66
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:32,460
What does the Qian family
have to do with this?

67
00:04:32,460 --> 00:04:34,820
On the surface, the Qian family
runs a herbal medicine business.

68
00:04:34,820 --> 00:04:35,630
But behind the scenes,

69
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:37,580
they make the drugs
collected from Blind Du

70
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:39,780
into an ointment called Bashen Powder,

71
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:41,260
raking in money

72
00:04:41,670 --> 00:04:43,000
and harming the people.

73
00:04:43,310 --> 00:04:44,510
Your empty words

74
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:45,960
are hardly convincing.

75
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,120
All the Qian family's shady deeds

76
00:04:48,130 --> 00:04:49,930
are recorded in a secret ledger.

77
00:04:50,110 --> 00:04:51,700
If we can bring it to light,

78
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:53,270
Commander Feng,

79
00:04:53,780 --> 00:04:55,590
you will be upholding justice for all.

80
00:04:55,590 --> 00:04:58,390
I've always engraved
Mr. Sun's saying in my heart—

81
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,510
the world belongs to the public.

82
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:05,140
If you can raid the Qian family,

83
00:05:05,140 --> 00:05:06,310
you'll rid the people

84
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:08,380
of the threat of drugs
for the public good.

85
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:09,440
You'll confiscate

86
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:11,460
the illicit possessions and keep
the region safe, also for the public good.

87
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:12,020
This is

88
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:14,130
a good deal for the public good.

89
00:05:14,130 --> 00:05:15,080
I also keep

90
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:17,030
Mr. Sun's saying in my heart—

91
00:05:17,780 --> 00:05:19,580
the world belongs to the public.

92
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,260
"The world belongs to the public."
Nice.

93
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:25,900
But

94
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:27,950
I need to borrow something from you

95
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:29,670
before I visit the Qian family this time.

96
00:05:29,670 --> 00:05:30,200
Go ahead.

97
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:32,770
Why should I trust you?

98
00:05:32,900 --> 00:05:35,159
You can check the license plate out there

99
00:05:35,330 --> 00:05:36,670
and see if it's
from the division headquarters.

100
00:05:36,670 --> 00:05:37,940
What if it's a stolen one?

101
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:40,400
And what if I really am
Commander Feng's man?

102
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:42,610
Can you bear the consequences

103
00:05:42,830 --> 00:05:45,290
of offending the Commander, Second Master?

104
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:47,720
Third Madam.

105
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:48,870
Third Madam.

106
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:50,870
A group of soldiers is at the door.

107
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:53,470
The leader says they're here
to deliver a gift.

108
00:05:54,020 --> 00:05:55,550
The grand gift has arrived.

109
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:57,580
Let him in.

110
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,409
Yes, Ma'am.

111
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:16,630
Sir,

112
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:18,260
here is what you asked for.

113
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,460
Commander Feng ordered me

114
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,060
to hand it to you personally.

115
00:06:21,190 --> 00:06:22,250
Put it on the table.

116
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:23,350
Yes, Sir.

117
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,380
Second Master, won't you open it

118
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,390
to see if you like

119
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,630
the gift?

120
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,390
Who exactly are you?

121
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:03,460
Aren't you good at fortune-telling,
Second Master?

122
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,700
You businessmen believe

123
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:06,830
that investments must yield returns.

124
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:09,050
We in the military have a rule too.

125
00:07:09,510 --> 00:07:11,510
Once a gun is drawn, it must be fired.

126
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:12,490
Second Master,

127
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:15,030
take aim.

128
00:07:28,550 --> 00:07:29,410
Mr. Chengming,

129
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,630
please calm down.

130
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:33,110
I can't.

131
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:35,900
He is right.

132
00:07:36,380 --> 00:07:38,580
I did wipe out the entire Longxuya Branch
for Commander Feng.

133
00:07:38,580 --> 00:07:39,550
Do you know why?

134
00:07:41,110 --> 00:07:42,140
Because those frauds

135
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:44,600
used our soldiers' bodies
to smuggle opium.

136
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:47,000
They were soldiers,

137
00:07:47,750 --> 00:07:49,680
brothers to Commander Feng and me.

138
00:07:51,110 --> 00:07:52,909
Not your tools for making money.

139
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:54,310
What exactly is going on?

140
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:54,670
I...

141
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,220
I don't know.

142
00:07:56,380 --> 00:07:57,240
Second Master.

143
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:01,940
If someone desecrated
your brothers' bodies,

144
00:08:02,110 --> 00:08:03,990
would you just let it go?

145
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:05,120
Mr. Chengming,

146
00:08:05,260 --> 00:08:06,700
Mr. Chengming, please calm down.

147
00:08:06,700 --> 00:08:07,950
What soldiers?

148
00:08:08,110 --> 00:08:09,370
We really have no idea.

149
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:10,310
If Blind Du

150
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,190
really did such a heartless thing,

151
00:08:12,190 --> 00:08:13,520
then he deserved to die.

152
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:22,140
Such a man who deserved to die

153
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:24,870
was supposed to be executed in public.

154
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:27,140
But he died the night
before the execution.

155
00:08:27,140 --> 00:08:28,870
Don't you think he got off easy?

156
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:29,990
Then

157
00:08:30,750 --> 00:08:31,750
who did it?

158
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,159
The Tianxiang Sect.

159
00:08:39,549 --> 00:08:40,740
You and Blind Du

160
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:43,630
smuggled drugs behind
the Sect Master's back.

161
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:44,600
Blind Du's death

162
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:47,580
was the Sect Master
making an example of him.

163
00:08:47,580 --> 00:08:49,270
But if your Bashen Powder

164
00:08:49,270 --> 00:08:50,600
is escorted by our army,

165
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:52,240
you won't have to worry

166
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:54,390
about the Tianxiang Sect seeking revenge.

167
00:08:54,390 --> 00:08:55,910
After all, in these chaotic times,

168
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:58,440
what is safer than
having the army's backing?

169
00:08:58,950 --> 00:08:59,670
Then

170
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:01,820
how much does

171
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:03,820
Commander Feng want?

172
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:07,630
Commander Feng said

173
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:10,350
he only wants 30 percent of the profit.

174
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:18,820
What if I refuse?

175
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:20,190
Second Master, why do you

176
00:09:20,190 --> 00:09:21,950
think your whole family is still

177
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:22,880
living in peace?

178
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:24,700
To show his sincerity,

179
00:09:25,070 --> 00:09:26,390
Commander Feng has told the Sect Master

180
00:09:26,390 --> 00:09:27,790
not to touch your family.

181
00:09:28,620 --> 00:09:30,270
Commander Feng also said

182
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:32,790
that harmony brings wealth.

183
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,500
Second Master, don't listen to him.

184
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,660
He sent a severed head.

185
00:09:35,660 --> 00:09:38,120
What harmony and wealth
is he talking about?

186
00:09:41,830 --> 00:09:43,330
Amitabha.

187
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:57,740
You...

188
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:05,270
Mr. Chengming.

189
00:10:08,270 --> 00:10:09,190
If we can

190
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,620
cooperate with Commander Feng this time,

191
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:14,190
it will be a great blessing
for the Qian family.

192
00:10:14,190 --> 00:10:16,450
But this is a matter of great importance.

193
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:19,600
Please allow my brother and me
to discuss it further.

194
00:10:21,070 --> 00:10:22,200
As for the business,

195
00:10:22,790 --> 00:10:23,920
I can afford to wait.

196
00:10:24,460 --> 00:10:25,430
I'm just afraid

197
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:27,550
Commander Feng cannot.

198
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:28,980
I apologize

199
00:10:29,150 --> 00:10:30,190
for the offense today.

200
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:32,590
Please stay at our residence
for a few days.

201
00:10:33,310 --> 00:10:35,700
My second brother and sister-in-law
are getting married.

202
00:10:35,700 --> 00:10:36,580
If you don't mind,

203
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:37,580
please join us for the wedding.

204
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:40,390
It can also be considered a good omen

205
00:10:40,740 --> 00:10:42,220
for our future cooperation.

206
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,950
So, Second Master,
your wedding is approaching.

207
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:46,980
Then I thank you

208
00:10:47,850 --> 00:10:49,670
in advance for the wedding drink.

209
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,390
Huaiyi.

210
00:10:51,030 --> 00:10:52,190
What happened?

211
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:53,100
Shuyi.

212
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:54,560
It's a mess in here.

213
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:56,220
Let me have the servants clean it up.

214
00:10:56,220 --> 00:10:56,950
Listen to me.

215
00:10:57,190 --> 00:10:59,310
Don't be afraid of whatever you see later.

216
00:10:59,310 --> 00:11:00,100
I'm here.

217
00:11:04,050 --> 00:11:05,380
What exactly happened?

218
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:10,070
How could this happen?

219
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:11,870
This is so unlucky

220
00:11:12,670 --> 00:11:14,130
right before the wedding.

221
00:11:14,270 --> 00:11:14,980
Bear with it.

222
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,440
There are outsiders here.

223
00:11:19,190 --> 00:11:20,910
Let me introduce her.

224
00:11:21,460 --> 00:11:22,340
This is

225
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:24,340
the woman I'm about to marry,

226
00:11:24,860 --> 00:11:25,980
Jiang Shuyi.

227
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:27,620
Chengming,

228
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:29,030
I'm

229
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:30,700
a reckless man.

230
00:11:31,500 --> 00:11:32,790
Don't take what just happened

231
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:33,820
to heart.

232
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:35,700
Just as you said,

233
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:36,860
harmony

234
00:11:37,790 --> 00:11:39,220
brings wealth.

235
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,390
Do you know

236
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:49,500
Lyu Ruhui is from the Tianxiang Sect?

237
00:11:49,650 --> 00:11:52,650
How can I explain to
the Tianxiang Sect if you kill him?

238
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:55,390
The Tianxiang Sect
has already killed Blind Du.

239
00:11:55,390 --> 00:11:56,070
We

240
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:57,700
will be next.

241
00:11:57,950 --> 00:11:59,810
Our business of the Bashen Powder

242
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:02,030
has already broken
the Sect Master's rules.

243
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:03,860
Wouldn't it be a good thing

244
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:05,740
to have Commander Feng as our backer?

245
00:12:05,740 --> 00:12:07,670
Besides, they only want 30% of the profit.

246
00:12:07,670 --> 00:12:09,860
Can't you figure out this deal,
Second Brother?

247
00:12:09,860 --> 00:12:11,990
Do you know what you're talking about?

248
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:14,430
Am I the one who can't figure it out now?

249
00:12:14,430 --> 00:12:15,150
Feng has his eyes

250
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:17,030
on our Bashen Powder now.

251
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:19,550
So he eliminated Longxuya
on the surface first.

252
00:12:19,550 --> 00:12:20,580
Now he sent someone over

253
00:12:20,580 --> 00:12:22,910
to hypocritically talk about
cooperation with us.

254
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,340
He said he wants 30%.

255
00:12:24,790 --> 00:12:25,460
30%

256
00:12:25,910 --> 00:12:27,710
wouldn't even be enough for him.

257
00:12:27,790 --> 00:12:29,980
The reason Feng hasn't touched
our family yet

258
00:12:29,980 --> 00:12:32,150
is that only we know how to make
the Bashen Powder.

259
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,310
One day,

260
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,190
when we are squeezed dry by Feng,

261
00:12:35,190 --> 00:12:36,740
our fate will be worse than Blind Du's.

262
00:12:36,740 --> 00:12:37,550
Huaiyi!

263
00:12:38,950 --> 00:12:40,580
You are destined to face a disaster

264
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:41,700
this year.

265
00:12:42,220 --> 00:12:43,670
I practice every day

266
00:12:43,670 --> 00:12:45,600
just to ward off disasters for you.

267
00:12:48,550 --> 00:12:49,340
Huaiyi.

268
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:52,310
I'm taking the blame for this killing

269
00:12:52,310 --> 00:12:53,950
for you today.

270
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:00,500
Sister,

271
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:04,150
I won't say anything about you
messing with these things

272
00:13:04,150 --> 00:13:05,430
usually,

273
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:06,580
but now

274
00:13:06,740 --> 00:13:08,340
you're believing in the Buddha at home

275
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:10,270
and worshipping masters outside.

276
00:13:11,460 --> 00:13:12,670
Let me tell you,

277
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:15,700
they are all clay idols.

278
00:13:44,950 --> 00:13:46,010
Second Madam Qian.

279
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:49,770
You weren't even going to
invite me to your wedding?

280
00:13:49,910 --> 00:13:51,440
Only relatives and friends

281
00:13:51,670 --> 00:13:53,070
will come to the wedding.

282
00:13:53,420 --> 00:13:55,780
I've only just met you, Mr. Chengming.

283
00:13:56,340 --> 00:13:57,580
Why would I have invited you?

284
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:59,180
Whether you invite me or not,

285
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,460
I'm already here.

286
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:02,910
I just wonder whether this marriage

287
00:14:02,950 --> 00:14:04,460
is real or not.

288
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:07,910
What if it's real,

289
00:14:08,700 --> 00:14:09,900
and what if it's fake?

290
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:11,070
If it's real,

291
00:14:11,950 --> 00:14:14,030
I naturally have to prepare a big gift.

292
00:14:14,030 --> 00:14:15,100
If it's fake...

293
00:14:19,980 --> 00:14:21,790
Maybe I can help.

294
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:26,310
Stay out of my business.

295
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:31,740
Keep quiet.

296
00:14:34,700 --> 00:14:35,760
Second Madam Qian.

297
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:37,900
I'm here.

298
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:51,860
Is the road smooth?

299
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:57,930
Everything is normal.

300
00:14:57,950 --> 00:14:59,080
The Sect Master said

301
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:00,480
to close the net early.

302
00:15:00,750 --> 00:15:02,550
We must get the money as soon as possible.

303
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:04,220
I'll act immediately when I find a chance.

304
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:05,390
Then rest early.

305
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:22,820
Isn't the Qian family
with the Tianxiang Sect?

306
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:24,950
Would your own people attack your own?

307
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:26,880
Cooperating with Feng Siyuan

308
00:15:27,390 --> 00:15:29,320
is like asking a tiger for its hide.

309
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,480
I advise you not to play with fire.

310
00:15:33,070 --> 00:15:35,100
Shouldn't you give me an explanation

311
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:36,980
for what happened back then?

312
00:15:46,310 --> 00:15:48,770
You wouldn't believe
whatever I say anyway.

313
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:52,790
Do it.

314
00:15:54,270 --> 00:15:55,310
Mr. Chengming.

315
00:15:58,620 --> 00:15:59,430
Want to die?

316
00:16:00,950 --> 00:16:02,220
It's not that simple.

317
00:16:03,220 --> 00:16:04,340
Your life alone

318
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:07,580
can't make up
for the lives of my whole family.

319
00:16:07,580 --> 00:16:08,430
I know.

320
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:11,870
You're coming for
the entire Tianxiang Sect.

321
00:16:18,390 --> 00:16:19,950
He's just a fraud.

322
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:22,740
He sneaked into Longxuya using my name

323
00:16:22,740 --> 00:16:24,070
and killed Chief Du.

324
00:16:24,070 --> 00:16:26,130
Now he's coming for your Qian family.

325
00:16:31,430 --> 00:16:32,820
Honey, was my snoring

326
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:33,950
keeping you awake?

327
00:16:34,310 --> 00:16:35,310
Tomorrow,

328
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:37,980
go to Commander Feng's
division headquarters.

329
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:40,240
Check Shangguan Chengming's identity.

330
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:42,740
Honey, rest assured.

331
00:16:43,070 --> 00:16:44,430
Shangguan Chengming has nothing to do

332
00:16:44,430 --> 00:16:45,830
with the Tianxiang Sect.

333
00:16:46,070 --> 00:16:47,460
He came here

334
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,190
with Blind Du’s head.

335
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:56,750
Understood, Honey.

336
00:16:56,750 --> 00:16:59,580
I'll send someone there
first thing tomorrow morning.

337
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,340
Amitabha.

338
00:17:02,500 --> 00:17:03,980
Amitabha.

339
00:17:05,950 --> 00:17:06,869
Third Madam,

340
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:09,589
you invited me
to this salvation ritual today,

341
00:17:09,589 --> 00:17:10,829
and I can see

342
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:11,869
you have

343
00:17:11,869 --> 00:17:14,869
the compassion to deliver
all beings from suffering.

344
00:17:15,349 --> 00:17:17,079
You flatter me, Mr. Shangguan.

345
00:17:17,190 --> 00:17:19,190
I wonder if you and the Second Master

346
00:17:19,390 --> 00:17:22,390
have reached a decision
regarding this partnership?

347
00:17:23,290 --> 00:17:25,130
I am naturally willing

348
00:17:25,430 --> 00:17:27,020
to cooperate with Commander Feng.

349
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:27,869
It's just that...

350
00:17:27,869 --> 00:17:28,870
Third Madam.

351
00:17:29,150 --> 00:17:31,550
Who exactly calls the shots
in your family?

352
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,590
Buddhism or Taoism,

353
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:35,190
you have to pick one.

354
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:40,660
You don't seem like someone
who is easily swayed.

355
00:17:41,350 --> 00:17:43,150
If you think this deal is viable,

356
00:17:43,350 --> 00:17:46,080
hand over the account book
for the Bashen Powder.

357
00:17:46,260 --> 00:17:48,060
Once Commander Feng reviews it,

358
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:49,260
we have

359
00:17:50,350 --> 00:17:51,430
a deal.

360
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:52,630
The account book?

361
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:54,110
Since we are working together,

362
00:17:54,110 --> 00:17:54,840
the accounts

363
00:17:55,220 --> 00:17:56,630
naturally must be clear.

364
00:18:24,630 --> 00:18:26,390
I follow the righteous decree

365
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,300
to pacify the wandering souls.

366
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:29,670
May all beings be sheltered

367
00:18:29,670 --> 00:18:30,980
and all creations receive grace.

368
00:18:30,980 --> 00:18:32,460
May each return to their true nature.

369
00:18:32,460 --> 00:18:33,720
Let compassion spread

370
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:34,980
and bless the universe.

371
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:36,350
Bestow boundless mercy.

372
00:18:36,350 --> 00:18:38,020
Obey my command at once!

373
00:19:13,430 --> 00:19:14,020
Break!

374
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:36,110
Master.

375
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:38,630
Master.

376
00:19:40,870 --> 00:19:42,270
Master, are you alright?

377
00:19:42,430 --> 00:19:43,630
-Master.
-It’s fine.

378
00:19:52,220 --> 00:19:53,260
I had already sent away

379
00:19:53,260 --> 00:19:55,190
Lyu Ruhui's vengeful spirit,

380
00:19:55,590 --> 00:19:56,390
but an unknown

381
00:19:56,740 --> 00:19:58,590
surge of evil aura

382
00:19:59,060 --> 00:20:00,460
trapped his spirit

383
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:02,860
in the Qian family again.

384
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:05,180
Where would our family get an evil aura?

385
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:07,300
While fighting that evil aura,

386
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:08,780
I vaguely saw

387
00:20:09,110 --> 00:20:12,060
it was formed by a book.

388
00:20:12,260 --> 00:20:13,590
If I am not mistaken,

389
00:20:13,950 --> 00:20:14,870
it should be

390
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:16,430
Yama's

391
00:20:17,190 --> 00:20:18,630
Book of Life and Death.

392
00:20:19,020 --> 00:20:20,480
The Book of Life and Death?

393
00:20:20,670 --> 00:20:21,190
This...

394
00:20:21,670 --> 00:20:23,800
How could our family have such a thing?

395
00:20:23,870 --> 00:20:25,460
The records in that book

396
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:28,830
concern the lives and deaths of many.

397
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:31,110
But as to what exactly it is,

398
00:20:31,180 --> 00:20:33,300
I must trouble you to think carefully,

399
00:20:33,300 --> 00:20:34,780
Third Madam.

400
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:38,700
Master.

401
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:40,430
Then,

402
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:43,010
is there any other way

403
00:20:43,570 --> 00:20:45,430
to appease this vengeful spirit?

404
00:20:45,740 --> 00:20:46,910
Lyu Ruhui

405
00:20:47,260 --> 00:20:50,660
is tightly bound by the evil aura
of the Book of Life and Death.

406
00:20:51,150 --> 00:20:52,980
He cannot leave.

407
00:20:53,590 --> 00:20:55,540
To completely resolve this,

408
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:57,060
Third Madam,

409
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,910
you must find this

410
00:20:58,940 --> 00:21:00,550
Book of Life and Death.

411
00:22:33,220 --> 00:22:34,870
Help!

412
00:22:35,260 --> 00:22:36,500
Stay away!

413
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:37,740
Honey.

414
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:39,540
It's me. It's me.

415
00:22:41,090 --> 00:22:41,870
What's wrong?

416
00:22:41,870 --> 00:22:42,460
Nothing.

417
00:22:42,460 --> 00:22:43,110
What?

418
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:44,110
There's...

419
00:22:46,390 --> 00:22:47,630
There's nothing.

420
00:22:47,980 --> 00:22:49,150
What did you see?

421
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:50,070
Nothing.

422
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,570
Are you under too much stress lately?

423
00:22:54,070 --> 00:22:55,030
It's okay.

424
00:22:58,220 --> 00:23:00,870
It's okay.

425
00:23:01,460 --> 00:23:02,060
It's okay.

426
00:23:05,300 --> 00:23:05,870
Wenxin,

427
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:08,460
tell me,

428
00:23:08,780 --> 00:23:10,700
could the Book of Life and Death

429
00:23:11,020 --> 00:23:12,500
Master Chang mentioned

430
00:23:13,870 --> 00:23:15,150
be the ledger

431
00:23:15,430 --> 00:23:17,260
in Huaiyi's hands?

432
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:18,670
Why do you say that?

433
00:23:18,910 --> 00:23:20,430
Didn't the Master say

434
00:23:20,630 --> 00:23:22,120
every sum of money in that ledger

435
00:23:22,120 --> 00:23:24,990
represents a human life?

436
00:23:25,910 --> 00:23:27,970
Isn't that the Book of Life and Death?

437
00:23:28,980 --> 00:23:31,310
But the Bashen Powder
is all off the books.

438
00:23:31,390 --> 00:23:32,630
Our ledger only records

439
00:23:32,630 --> 00:23:33,460
our dealings

440
00:23:33,460 --> 00:23:35,460
with the Tianxiang Sect.

441
00:23:35,670 --> 00:23:37,350
Wouldn't it be a bad idea
to hand it over to someone else?

442
00:23:37,350 --> 00:23:37,880
Besides,

443
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:38,980
knowing your second brother,

444
00:23:38,980 --> 00:23:40,330
he wouldn't give it to you anyway.

445
00:23:40,330 --> 00:23:42,790
Whether he gives it to me or not,
I have to try!

446
00:23:44,190 --> 00:23:44,990
Otherwise...

447
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:47,500
Otherwise, our family may

448
00:23:47,740 --> 00:23:49,670
never make it through this ordeal.

449
00:23:50,830 --> 00:23:52,190
I'll figure something out.

450
00:23:52,190 --> 00:23:53,350
I'll figure something out.

451
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:54,110
It's okay.

452
00:24:06,350 --> 00:24:06,980
Sir.

453
00:24:07,390 --> 00:24:08,720
She gets scared easily.

454
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:10,310
I haven't even started yet.

455
00:24:23,220 --> 00:24:23,670
Here.

456
00:24:24,300 --> 00:24:25,020
It's hot.

457
00:24:27,150 --> 00:24:28,220
Here, Chengming.

458
00:24:28,780 --> 00:24:29,740
Try this.

459
00:24:30,060 --> 00:24:32,380
I had someone make
this duck soup just for you.

460
00:24:32,380 --> 00:24:33,870
That's very thoughtful of you, Wenxin.

461
00:24:33,870 --> 00:24:34,590
Don't mention it.

462
00:24:34,590 --> 00:24:35,430
Have a taste.

463
00:24:35,430 --> 00:24:35,960
Alright.

464
00:24:36,670 --> 00:24:39,270
The broth is made with foxnuts
and Job's tears.

465
00:24:39,300 --> 00:24:42,630
It nourishes Yin, reduces internal heat,
and replenishes your energy.

466
00:24:42,630 --> 00:24:43,630
See how it tastes.

467
00:24:44,670 --> 00:24:45,870
It tastes good.

468
00:24:55,870 --> 00:24:57,780
Wenxin, you didn't come today

469
00:24:58,500 --> 00:25:00,560
just to bring me a bowl of soup, right?

470
00:25:03,830 --> 00:25:04,590
Chengming,

471
00:25:04,870 --> 00:25:05,670
rest assured.

472
00:25:05,910 --> 00:25:07,150
I will do whatever it takes

473
00:25:07,150 --> 00:25:08,780
to get that ledger for you.

474
00:25:09,110 --> 00:25:10,150
Not everyone

475
00:25:10,630 --> 00:25:11,540
can see the situation

476
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:12,980
as clearly as you do.

477
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:15,350
If we can make this deal happen,

478
00:25:15,350 --> 00:25:16,060
you'll

479
00:25:16,390 --> 00:25:17,990
have earned the most credit.

480
00:25:18,150 --> 00:25:18,910
My friend,

481
00:25:19,870 --> 00:25:21,460
if I get this done,

482
00:25:21,910 --> 00:25:23,460
I have a favor to ask.

483
00:25:28,700 --> 00:25:29,260
Honey,

484
00:25:29,460 --> 00:25:30,830
I've asked around.

485
00:25:31,060 --> 00:25:34,390
Shangguan Chengming is indeed
Commander Feng's adjutant.

486
00:25:37,630 --> 00:25:39,460
The Master once told our family

487
00:25:39,460 --> 00:25:40,950
that we'd eventually face a great ordeal.

488
00:25:40,950 --> 00:25:42,740
He wrote this poem
while giving me guidance.

489
00:25:42,740 --> 00:25:43,940
Look at the last line.

490
00:25:44,150 --> 00:25:46,780
This character is
Commander Feng's surname, isn't it?

491
00:25:46,780 --> 00:25:48,460
"Finally meeting a worthy man"—

492
00:25:48,460 --> 00:25:50,390
doesn't that mean Commander Feng?

493
00:25:50,670 --> 00:25:52,220
It has to be Commander Feng.

494
00:25:55,430 --> 00:25:56,430
That makes sense.

495
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:01,630
Huaiyi,

496
00:26:01,740 --> 00:26:02,980
before our wedding,

497
00:26:02,980 --> 00:26:04,870
I asked a married woman blessed
with good fortune to comb my hair.

498
00:26:04,870 --> 00:26:05,630
She told me

499
00:26:05,630 --> 00:26:06,950
to leave this comb here

500
00:26:06,950 --> 00:26:08,430
for a few days as an offering

501
00:26:08,430 --> 00:26:09,300
for good luck.

502
00:26:10,260 --> 00:26:10,740
Master.

503
00:26:10,950 --> 00:26:11,260
Madam.

504
00:26:11,260 --> 00:26:12,590
I've brought it for you.

505
00:26:18,700 --> 00:26:19,110
It...

506
00:26:19,910 --> 00:26:20,640
It's broken.

507
00:26:20,780 --> 00:26:21,980
It's okay. It's okay.

508
00:26:22,430 --> 00:26:23,500
Just leave it to me.

509
00:26:25,190 --> 00:26:27,150
The Red Phoenix Star shines over you both—

510
00:26:27,150 --> 00:26:28,410
great joy is on its way.

511
00:26:29,060 --> 00:26:29,590
Madam,

512
00:26:29,830 --> 00:26:30,950
your face is glowing like a peach blossom;

513
00:26:30,950 --> 00:26:32,350
you will bring your husband good fortune
and prosperity to the family.

514
00:26:32,350 --> 00:26:33,280
You are destined

515
00:26:38,060 --> 00:26:40,190
to turn misfortune into good fortune.

516
00:26:40,630 --> 00:26:41,630
Huaiyi, look.

517
00:26:42,390 --> 00:26:43,700
Didn't it just break?

518
00:26:45,910 --> 00:26:47,910
Turn misfortune into good fortune.

519
00:26:48,110 --> 00:26:49,240
What does that mean?

520
00:26:49,540 --> 00:26:51,220
You came for money,

521
00:26:51,590 --> 00:26:53,220
and you will leave for money.

522
00:26:54,700 --> 00:26:55,430
Benefactor,

523
00:26:55,830 --> 00:26:57,430
is your surname Qian—money?

524
00:26:58,830 --> 00:26:59,630
Then, Master,

525
00:26:59,910 --> 00:27:01,060
tell me,

526
00:27:01,740 --> 00:27:02,870
what is my surname?

527
00:27:03,260 --> 00:27:05,700
Half full, half empty.

528
00:27:06,390 --> 00:27:08,920
The water god Gonggong
does not cause a flood.

529
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,190
Your

530
00:27:10,700 --> 00:27:12,100
surname is Jiang—river.

531
00:27:13,740 --> 00:27:15,220
Then what did you mean

532
00:27:16,220 --> 00:27:17,220
by the misfortune

533
00:27:17,700 --> 00:27:18,830
you just mentioned?

534
00:27:19,540 --> 00:27:21,870
Once you enter the military,
thousands will die.

535
00:27:21,870 --> 00:27:24,430
You hold snow with wet hands
and never make it home.

536
00:27:24,430 --> 00:27:25,910
Your current situation

537
00:27:26,020 --> 00:27:27,500
is like being trapped

538
00:27:27,500 --> 00:27:29,900
among thousands upon thousands of troops.

539
00:27:32,650 --> 00:27:33,450
Then, Master,

540
00:27:34,430 --> 00:27:35,830
is there anything I can do

541
00:27:36,460 --> 00:27:37,830
to avert it?

542
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:38,830
I'm afraid

543
00:27:39,590 --> 00:27:42,220
you've recently meddled in a karmic matter
you shouldn't have.

544
00:27:42,220 --> 00:27:42,950
You'd better

545
00:27:42,980 --> 00:27:43,980
make plans early.

546
00:27:44,500 --> 00:27:45,220
That's

547
00:27:45,350 --> 00:27:46,780
all I can say.

548
00:27:47,430 --> 00:27:48,490
Thank you, Master.

549
00:27:53,190 --> 00:27:55,190
It's a good thing we came here today.

550
00:27:55,220 --> 00:27:56,780
We really need to watch our backs

551
00:27:56,780 --> 00:27:58,150
from now on.

552
00:27:58,540 --> 00:27:59,780
I think

553
00:28:00,190 --> 00:28:02,300
what he said makes some sense.

554
00:28:02,780 --> 00:28:05,500
We did offend Commander Feng recently.

555
00:28:05,980 --> 00:28:07,640
I just can't shake the feeling

556
00:28:07,910 --> 00:28:09,510
that something's not right.

557
00:28:10,020 --> 00:28:10,670
Huaiyi,

558
00:28:11,300 --> 00:28:12,670
don't you think

559
00:28:13,150 --> 00:28:15,060
we'd be better off keeping

560
00:28:15,390 --> 00:28:16,590
the money ourselves?

561
00:28:17,260 --> 00:28:18,260
What if

562
00:28:18,700 --> 00:28:20,150
we have children someday?

563
00:28:20,150 --> 00:28:22,480
We wouldn't want them to starve, would we?

564
00:28:24,630 --> 00:28:25,360
Don't worry.

565
00:28:25,870 --> 00:28:26,870
I'll take care of

566
00:28:27,300 --> 00:28:28,590
both you

567
00:28:29,300 --> 00:28:30,390
and our kids.

568
00:28:31,060 --> 00:28:31,920
Stop worrying.

569
00:28:47,260 --> 00:28:47,950
Chengming,

570
00:28:48,390 --> 00:28:49,830
if I get this done,

571
00:28:50,380 --> 00:28:51,860
I have a favor to ask.

572
00:28:52,350 --> 00:28:53,680
Please speak your mind.

573
00:28:53,870 --> 00:28:54,670
I'd like

574
00:28:55,590 --> 00:28:58,520
to serve under you,
if you could find me a position...

575
00:29:04,110 --> 00:29:04,640
Alright.

576
00:29:05,060 --> 00:29:05,990
You have my word.

577
00:29:06,050 --> 00:29:06,920
Thank you.

578
00:29:07,190 --> 00:29:08,150
If this deal

579
00:29:08,150 --> 00:29:09,910
really is thanks to you,

580
00:29:10,670 --> 00:29:11,430
from now on,

581
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:13,220
you won't ever have to

582
00:29:13,220 --> 00:29:15,220
live by other people's whims again.

583
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,280
What are you looking for?

584
00:29:56,300 --> 00:29:56,590
Huai...

585
00:29:56,590 --> 00:29:57,060
Huaiyi.

586
00:29:57,420 --> 00:29:58,820
What are you looking for?

587
00:29:59,010 --> 00:30:00,140
Tell me,

588
00:30:01,350 --> 00:30:02,750
and I'll help you find it.

589
00:30:13,830 --> 00:30:14,500
Huaiyi,

590
00:30:14,980 --> 00:30:16,430
what's all this

591
00:30:17,150 --> 00:30:18,190
commotion about?

592
00:30:21,630 --> 00:30:22,500
Chengming,

593
00:30:23,670 --> 00:30:24,870
please don't take offense.

594
00:30:24,870 --> 00:30:27,940
Since we'll be doing business
together from now on,

595
00:30:28,380 --> 00:30:30,780
I asked you to join us today
and see for yourself

596
00:30:30,780 --> 00:30:31,830
and learn about

597
00:30:32,260 --> 00:30:33,660
the rules our Qian family

598
00:30:33,830 --> 00:30:36,160
has passed down through the generations.

599
00:30:41,150 --> 00:30:41,780
Huaiyi.

600
00:30:42,260 --> 00:30:42,870
Honey.

601
00:30:49,460 --> 00:30:50,990
I asked everyone here today

602
00:30:51,060 --> 00:30:51,870
because

603
00:30:52,590 --> 00:30:53,740
there is a thief

604
00:30:53,950 --> 00:30:55,060
in the Qian family.

605
00:30:55,390 --> 00:30:56,430
I am not a thief.

606
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,430
I am not a thief.

607
00:30:57,430 --> 00:30:58,630
If you are not a thief,

608
00:30:58,910 --> 00:31:00,300
what were you doing in my study?

609
00:31:00,300 --> 00:31:00,590
I...

610
00:31:00,780 --> 00:31:01,060
I...

611
00:31:01,260 --> 00:31:01,870
Were you trying to steal money?

612
00:31:01,870 --> 00:31:02,950
No,

613
00:31:02,950 --> 00:31:03,780
absolutely not.

614
00:31:03,780 --> 00:31:05,440
If it was not money, then what?

615
00:31:11,020 --> 00:31:11,670
Someone.

616
00:31:12,190 --> 00:31:14,050
Bring out the family punishment.

617
00:31:21,610 --> 00:31:22,350
Huaiyi,

618
00:31:22,910 --> 00:31:25,310
we haven't gotten
to the bottom of this yet.

619
00:31:25,430 --> 00:31:26,760
Don't do anything rash.

620
00:31:27,460 --> 00:31:28,060
Shuyi,

621
00:31:28,870 --> 00:31:29,590
sit down.

622
00:31:30,430 --> 00:31:31,690
A country has its laws,

623
00:31:31,740 --> 00:31:33,200
and a family has its rules.

624
00:31:34,020 --> 00:31:35,390
No matter who he is,

625
00:31:35,870 --> 00:31:36,980
he must

626
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,740
conduct himself.

627
00:31:40,110 --> 00:31:40,540
Talk.

628
00:31:40,980 --> 00:31:42,710
What were you doing in my study?

629
00:32:15,260 --> 00:32:15,950
Wenxin,

630
00:32:16,780 --> 00:32:18,670
I'll give you one last chance.

631
00:32:19,390 --> 00:32:20,060
Talk.

632
00:32:21,500 --> 00:32:23,560
What exactly were you trying to steal

633
00:32:23,630 --> 00:32:24,950
from my study?

634
00:32:27,110 --> 00:32:28,780
Chengming is right.

635
00:32:29,110 --> 00:32:31,950
We have no choice but to cooperate
with Commander Feng now.

636
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:34,680
It's only natural that he wants
to see the ledger.

637
00:32:35,500 --> 00:32:37,260
Why are you still hesitating?

638
00:32:39,670 --> 00:32:40,780
It seems

639
00:32:41,590 --> 00:32:43,870
someone is backing you up.

640
00:32:45,250 --> 00:32:47,350
You've even got the nerve
to talk to me like this.

641
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:48,060
Huaijin.

642
00:32:49,670 --> 00:32:51,800
So this is the dog you've been raising.

643
00:32:54,950 --> 00:32:56,390
Careful, one day

644
00:32:56,460 --> 00:32:57,980
this ungrateful beast

645
00:32:58,260 --> 00:32:59,980
will bite you back.

646
00:33:24,020 --> 00:33:24,740
Honey.

647
00:34:17,060 --> 00:34:18,590
How could he be so ruthless?

648
00:34:19,540 --> 00:34:20,350
Wenxin,

649
00:34:21,710 --> 00:34:23,350
everyone was there.

650
00:34:23,659 --> 00:34:24,500
I had no choice

651
00:34:25,750 --> 00:34:27,500
but to hit you.

652
00:34:28,949 --> 00:34:29,460
Come on.

653
00:34:29,620 --> 00:34:30,580
Give it to me.

654
00:34:32,659 --> 00:34:34,540
I brought our ancestral wound medicine.

655
00:34:34,540 --> 00:34:35,830
Let me put some on.

656
00:34:44,389 --> 00:34:45,120
Does it hurt?

657
00:34:47,750 --> 00:34:48,710
Hang in there.

658
00:35:03,100 --> 00:35:04,060
Miss Shuyi,

659
00:35:04,390 --> 00:35:06,270
I've brought your bird's nest porridge.

660
00:35:06,270 --> 00:35:07,020
Come in.

661
00:35:17,950 --> 00:35:18,830
Enjoy.

662
00:35:23,310 --> 00:35:25,100
After Zhou Wenxin's scene,

663
00:35:25,350 --> 00:35:26,530
it seems Second Master has come around

664
00:35:26,530 --> 00:35:27,930
to depositing the money.

665
00:35:28,660 --> 00:35:30,260
The Sect Master wants to know

666
00:35:30,950 --> 00:35:32,950
when you're going to make your move.

667
00:35:35,750 --> 00:35:36,500
Today.

668
00:36:13,940 --> 00:36:15,140
Everything's ready?

669
00:36:16,700 --> 00:36:18,300
Why are you sweating so much?

670
00:36:20,500 --> 00:36:21,270
Huaiyi,

671
00:36:22,660 --> 00:36:24,580
are you sure you want to put
all this money

672
00:36:24,580 --> 00:36:25,710
in my name

673
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:27,230
instead of leaving it with Huaijin?

674
00:36:27,230 --> 00:36:30,020
Huaijin and Zhou Wenxin
are clearly in on it together.

675
00:36:30,020 --> 00:36:31,790
I think they

676
00:36:32,180 --> 00:36:34,500
have fallen
for Shangguan Chengming's scheme.

677
00:36:34,500 --> 00:36:35,180
They're not

678
00:36:36,140 --> 00:36:38,180
the ones who get
to call the shots in this family.

679
00:36:38,180 --> 00:36:39,240
Actually, Huaijin

680
00:36:39,620 --> 00:36:41,080
must have her own reasons.

681
00:36:41,430 --> 00:36:42,150
Let's

682
00:36:42,180 --> 00:36:43,580
give her the ledger.

683
00:36:43,790 --> 00:36:45,790
That should make her feel better.

684
00:36:46,430 --> 00:36:48,140
We'd already had something
unpleasant happen that day.

685
00:36:48,140 --> 00:36:49,870
If you upset everyone again,

686
00:36:50,390 --> 00:36:52,180
how are we supposed to get married?

687
00:36:52,180 --> 00:36:53,100
I don't want to

688
00:36:53,260 --> 00:36:55,980
marry into your Qian family
with everyone at odds.

689
00:36:55,980 --> 00:36:57,710
Well, aren't you considerate?

690
00:36:57,710 --> 00:36:59,350
Honey. You're truly understanding

691
00:36:59,350 --> 00:37:00,150
and generous.

692
00:37:01,350 --> 00:37:02,430
It's just that

693
00:37:03,020 --> 00:37:04,020
my eldest brother

694
00:37:04,150 --> 00:37:05,830
has always kept the ledger.

695
00:37:06,140 --> 00:37:07,200
Speaking of which,

696
00:37:07,790 --> 00:37:10,350
I'm also the future daughter-in-law
of your Qian family.

697
00:37:10,350 --> 00:37:11,640
Should I go

698
00:37:11,910 --> 00:37:13,640
and visit your eldest brother?

699
00:37:13,980 --> 00:37:14,830
No need.

700
00:37:15,270 --> 00:37:16,350
My eldest brother is a bit eccentric

701
00:37:16,350 --> 00:37:17,790
and rarely sees anyone.

702
00:37:18,180 --> 00:37:19,350
You will naturally meet him

703
00:37:19,350 --> 00:37:20,410
on our wedding day.

704
00:37:52,580 --> 00:37:53,430
Hello, Miss.

705
00:37:53,710 --> 00:37:54,710
Can I deposit this amount here

706
00:37:54,710 --> 00:37:56,230
and withdraw it

707
00:37:56,390 --> 00:37:57,100
in Nanyang?

708
00:37:57,180 --> 00:37:58,230
As long as it's a Meifeng Bank branch,

709
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:59,890
you can withdraw it anywhere.

710
00:38:01,540 --> 00:38:02,230
Sir,

711
00:38:02,540 --> 00:38:03,580
that's too large an amount

712
00:38:03,580 --> 00:38:04,580
for me to authorize.

713
00:38:04,580 --> 00:38:06,460
I'll need to call our bank manager.

714
00:38:06,460 --> 00:38:07,540
Can you call them now?

715
00:38:07,540 --> 00:38:08,340
I'm in a hurry.

716
00:38:09,540 --> 00:38:10,140
All right.

717
00:38:10,180 --> 00:38:10,910
Come with me.

718
00:38:14,540 --> 00:38:15,390
What are you doing?

719
00:38:15,390 --> 00:38:15,750
This way, please.

720
00:38:15,750 --> 00:38:17,060
Watch where you're going!

721
00:38:17,060 --> 00:38:18,140
Are you blind?

722
00:38:18,500 --> 00:38:19,620
That's enough, Huaiyi.

723
00:38:19,620 --> 00:38:20,940
He didn't do it on purpose.

724
00:38:20,940 --> 00:38:21,710
Don't be mad.

725
00:38:24,350 --> 00:38:25,210
I'm sorry, sir.

726
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:26,790
Stupid.

727
00:38:31,270 --> 00:38:31,790
Hello.

728
00:38:31,910 --> 00:38:32,910
How can I help you?

729
00:38:33,060 --> 00:38:33,910
I want to deposit some money.

730
00:38:33,910 --> 00:38:34,420
Just a moment.

731
00:38:34,420 --> 00:38:35,730
Once I've counted the money,

732
00:38:35,730 --> 00:38:37,930
I'll give you the deposit certificate.

733
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:44,560
[Women's bathroom]

734
00:39:00,410 --> 00:39:01,380
Okay, Manager.

735
00:39:03,540 --> 00:39:04,750
I'm sorry, sir.

736
00:39:04,780 --> 00:39:08,440
Our manager said the interest rate
you're asking for is a bit high.

737
00:39:10,910 --> 00:39:11,510
All right.

738
00:39:17,750 --> 00:39:18,610
How about this?

739
00:39:19,020 --> 00:39:20,620
I can settle for a lower interest rate,

740
00:39:20,620 --> 00:39:22,390
as long as I can make a fixed-term deposit
and withdraw it at maturity.

741
00:39:22,390 --> 00:39:23,320
Could you please

742
00:39:23,500 --> 00:39:24,830
talk to the manager again?

743
00:39:24,830 --> 00:39:25,390
Okay.

744
00:39:25,620 --> 00:39:26,460
Please have a seat.

745
00:39:26,460 --> 00:39:26,980
Okay.

746
00:39:31,390 --> 00:39:32,910
Can you hurry up?

747
00:39:51,270 --> 00:39:52,750
Sorry, Mr. Qian.

748
00:39:53,140 --> 00:39:54,270
Sorry to keep you waiting.

749
00:39:54,270 --> 00:39:55,460
Here's your deposit certificate.

750
00:39:55,460 --> 00:39:56,360
You can withdraw it
at any branch nationwide.

751
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:57,590
Just sign here.

752
00:40:13,380 --> 00:40:14,640
Please keep this safe.

753
00:40:18,500 --> 00:40:19,100
Thank you.

754
00:40:19,150 --> 00:40:20,010
Have a good day.

755
00:40:26,180 --> 00:40:27,420
Let's go get that bag first.

756
00:40:27,420 --> 00:40:29,100
You also like that bracelet, right?

757
00:40:29,100 --> 00:40:29,620
No need, Huaiyi.

758
00:40:29,620 --> 00:40:30,500
Huaiyi, Shuyi.

759
00:40:33,390 --> 00:40:34,520
What a coincidence.

760
00:40:34,790 --> 00:40:37,060
What brings you to the bank in person?

761
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:41,660
Come on.

762
00:40:41,830 --> 00:40:43,180
Stop beating around the bush.

763
00:40:43,180 --> 00:40:44,950
You're here to deposit money,
aren't you, Huaiyi?

764
00:40:44,950 --> 00:40:45,480
Huaijin,

765
00:40:45,870 --> 00:40:46,830
whatever it is,

766
00:40:47,460 --> 00:40:48,710
let's talk about it at home.

767
00:40:48,710 --> 00:40:49,570
Second Master,

768
00:40:49,710 --> 00:40:51,660
let me ask you something
on Commander Feng's behalf.

769
00:40:51,660 --> 00:40:53,730
Are you planning to transfer
the money and run?

770
00:40:53,730 --> 00:40:56,100
You say one thing to our faces
and do another behind our backs.

771
00:40:56,100 --> 00:40:57,350
Do you take me for a fool,

772
00:40:57,350 --> 00:40:59,660
or do you think Commander Feng
is someone you can push around?

773
00:40:59,660 --> 00:41:00,580
I think

774
00:41:01,350 --> 00:41:02,570
this is our family matter.

775
00:41:02,570 --> 00:41:04,970
I can't interfere
with your family matter.

776
00:41:05,360 --> 00:41:07,490
But if you choose to learn the hard way,

777
00:41:08,710 --> 00:41:10,830
when the Tiansang Sect comes knocking,

778
00:41:10,830 --> 00:41:11,620
I hope

779
00:41:12,620 --> 00:41:14,710
you'll still be this tough then.

780
00:41:15,660 --> 00:41:16,390
Huaiyi,

781
00:41:16,870 --> 00:41:17,800
Let's have a look

782
00:41:17,910 --> 00:41:19,510
at the deposit certificate.

783
00:41:41,540 --> 00:41:43,740
You deposited all the money
in her name?

784
00:41:44,950 --> 00:41:45,540
Huaijin,

785
00:41:45,790 --> 00:41:46,660
you misunderstood.

786
00:41:46,660 --> 00:41:48,500
Although the money is in my name,

787
00:41:48,710 --> 00:41:49,870
Huaiyi was going to give you

788
00:41:49,870 --> 00:41:51,500
this deposit certificate
when he got home.

789
00:41:51,500 --> 00:41:52,710
Without this deposit certificate,

790
00:41:52,710 --> 00:41:54,370
no one can withdraw the money.

791
00:41:57,020 --> 00:41:58,710
Since you trust me,

792
00:41:59,140 --> 00:41:59,980
I'll hold on

793
00:42:00,500 --> 00:42:02,500
to the deposit certificate for now.

794
00:42:08,980 --> 00:42:09,540
This one.

795
00:42:11,610 --> 00:42:12,650
Try them all.

796
00:42:13,100 --> 00:42:13,980
All of them?

797
00:42:14,460 --> 00:42:15,350
All of them.

798
00:42:15,420 --> 00:42:16,420
This way, please.

799
00:42:22,980 --> 00:42:23,940
Take your time.

800
00:42:29,310 --> 00:42:31,570
Mr. Qian, let's take your measurements.

801
00:42:32,500 --> 00:42:34,430
Let's measure your arm span first.

802
00:42:40,870 --> 00:42:41,490
Coming.

803
00:42:47,690 --> 00:42:49,020
Are you out of your mind?

804
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:58,370
[In the next episode]

805
00:42:58,410 --> 00:42:59,280
Do you know

806
00:42:59,310 --> 00:43:00,600
where the Qian family's

807
00:43:00,600 --> 00:43:01,800
eldest master lives?

808
00:43:02,170 --> 00:43:03,540
Who are you?

809
00:43:04,170 --> 00:43:06,240
Who brought you here?

810
00:43:06,540 --> 00:43:07,990
I'm here to buy some medicine.

811
00:43:07,990 --> 00:43:10,260
You're here to buy medicine?

812
00:43:10,280 --> 00:43:11,410
Please go upstairs.

813
00:43:12,130 --> 00:43:13,790
Why didn't you light the lamp?

814
00:43:14,890 --> 00:43:17,290
There's something wrong with this candle.

815
00:43:17,710 --> 00:43:18,790
Wake up, bro.

816
00:43:20,550 --> 00:43:21,490
Eldest Master.

817
00:43:21,780 --> 00:43:23,110
Second Master and Second Madam

818
00:43:23,110 --> 00:43:24,550
asked me to bring you some wedding candy.
